sequenceDiagram
  participant L as Lab loop (host)
  participant C as MCP client
  participant S as MCP server (stdio)
  participant A as Claude API
  C->>S: server/discover
  S-->>C: versions + capabilities
  C->>S: tools/list
  S-->>C: names, descriptions, inputSchemas
  C-->>L: tools renamed server__tool
  L->>A: messages + tool definitions
  A-->>L: tool_use tickets__search_tickets
  L->>C: call search_tickets(query)
  C->>S: tools/call + _meta
  S-->>C: content, isError false
  C-->>L: result text
  L->>A: tool_result
  A-->>L: next tool_use or final answer
